   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Special Audit MACCIH</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Special Audit MACCIH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MACCIH is a mission established by an agreement between GS / OAS and the Government of Honduras on January 19, 2016. MACCIH is part of OAS&apos;s Sustainable Democracy and Special Mission (DSDSM) Secretariat for GS / OAS Democracy.Given that MACCIH is a relatively new and untested mission, it is considered desirable to carry out an institutional capacity study.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MACCIH &#xe4;r en mission som etablerades genom ett avtal mellan GS/OAS och Honduras regering den 19 januari 2016. MACCIH tillh&#xf6;r OAS&#x2019;s avdelning f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar demokrati och s&#xe4;rskilda missioner (DSDSM) under sekretariatet f&#xf6;r st&#xe4;rkande av demokrati hos GS/OAS. Givet att MACCIH &#xe4;r en relativt ny och opr&#xf6;vad mission s&#xe5; bed&#xf6;ms det som &#xf6;nskv&#xe4;rt att genomf&#xf6;ra en institutionell kapacitetsstudie.</narrative>
  </description>
